#: src117/port/front/port_front_bench.cpp:1356
msgid "Free For All: every computer for itself. Melee: the original’s, where every computer is on one side and nothing fights, kept to compare with it. Team Match: the computers on teams, allied, sharing vision and winning together; Quick layout sets the teams from the map’s starts. Team Match plays by Hyperion’s rules. Runs are the same game only with the same teams and starts."
